## 🧪 Running the Project

### 1. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install openai

### 2.Run the agent
```bash
python main.py


## Design Principles
Minimize user friction
Maximize inferred data
Keep decision logic explainable
Separate inference from orchestration
Gracefully degrade when confidence is low



## ⚠️ Notes
Zillow API is mocked for demonstration purposes
Confidence scores are prior-based and need to be updated online
The system is designed to be easily extended to real APIs


## 💡 Future Improvements

Replace mock APIs with real integrations

Learning loop from historical user data

Improve confidence calibration using real distributions